%% Sequence Diagram: Post Creation Flow
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Utilisateur
  participant FE as Frontend (Vue.js)
  participant API as API Laravel
  participant DB as Base de Données
  participant NTF as Service Notifications

  U->>FE: Rédiger contenu + joindre médias
  FE->>API: POST /api/posts (multipart)
  API->>DB: Insert Post + Media refs
  DB-->>API: Post ID
  API->>API: Calcul initial (compteurs=0)
  API-->>FE: 201 { post }
  FE-->>U: Affiche le post créé
  API->>NTF: Publie événement (post.created)
  NTF->>Followers: Notification push (async)
